@baseUrl = http://localhost:5188
@batchId = 1

### Batch list includes exact unread document counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/batches

### Batch-scoped historical or active document snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/batches/{{batchId}}/documents

### Invalid batch
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/batches/2147483647/documents

### Historical document activity; use an actual batch ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/admin?batchId={{batchId}}
